        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:8.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <span style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Mr.&#160;Levin has served as Executive Chairman of the Board of Angi since April&#160;1, 2025, Chief Executive Officer of Angi from October&#160;10, 2022 through April&#160;4, 2024 and as Chief Executive Officer of IAC from June&#160;24, 2015 through March&#160;31, 2025. During his tenure with IAC, Mr.&#160;Levin did not receive any compensation for his service as Chief Executive Officer of Angi directly from Angi. Instead, $130,833 of his IAC base salary was allocated to Angi as cost based upon time spent on Angi by Mr.&#160;Levin in 2024. During the time in 2025 that Mr. Levin served as Chief Executive Officer of IAC and non-executive Chairman of the Board of Angi, he did not receive any compensation allocated to Angi for his services as Chairman of the Board of Angi. </span>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
